<title>USA: Tektronix to buy back up to 1 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Tektronix to buy back up to 1 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>WILSONVILLE, Ore. 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tektronix Inc said Wednesday its board of directors has increased its stock repurchase program to up to 1 million common shares.</p>
<p>Repurchased shares will be used to offset share issuances from the exercise of options under the company's stock incentive programs.</p>
<p>At the end of May the company had about 33.3 million shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
